msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr "और कुछ?"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "api_error_contact"
msgid "If the problem persists, contact us at {0} or join our {1} for direct support."
msgstr "यदि समस्या बनी रहती है, तो {0} पर हमसे संपर्क करें या सीधे समर्थन के लिए हमारे {1} से जुड़ें।"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): shown briefly in place of Copy key (api_keys_copy) after the key was copied. Apple reads this English from the crypto_invoice_copied entry (one catalog entry per English text), so this key is not tagged apple.
msgctxt "api_keys_copied"
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "कॉपी हो गया"

