msgctxt "api_keys_copy"
msgid "Copy key"
msgstr "कुंजी कॉपी करें"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): the action that creates a new API key: the screen's button, and the title or confirm button of the form that asks for the key's name.
msgctxt "api_keys_create"
msgid "Create API key"
msgstr "API कुंजी बनाएँ"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): shown when creating a new key failed.
msgctxt "api_keys_create_failed"
msgid "Couldn't create the API key. Try again."
msgstr "API कुंजी नहीं बनाई जा सकी। पुनः प्रयास करें।"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): a key's row, the line under its name. {date} is the date the key was created, already formatted by the app ("Oct 29, 2026"), inserted as is, so no case ending or preposition can attach to it.
msgctxt "api_keys_created_at"
msgid "Created {}"
msgstr "बनाई गई: {}"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): title of the sheet that shows a newly created key in full. This is the only time the key is ever shown.
msgctxt "api_keys_created_title"
msgid "Your new API key"
msgstr "आपकी नई API कुंजी"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): the warning on the sheet that shows a newly created key. The key is shown only this once, and anyone who has it has full access to the account.
msgctxt "api_keys_created_warning"
msgid "Copy this key now. It won't be shown again, and anyone who has it can use your account."
msgstr "यह कुंजी अभी कॉपी करें। यह दोबारा नहीं दिखाई जाएगी, और जिसके पास भी यह हो, वह आपके खाते का उपयोग कर सकता है।"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): the action on a key's row that deletes the key, and the destructive button of the confirmation that follows. Apple reads this English from the delete entry (one catalog entry per English text), so this key is not tagged apple.
msgctxt "api_keys_delete"
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "डिलीट करें"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): body of the confirmation before a key is deleted. {name} is the key's name as the user gave it ("home server"), or api_keys_unnamed ("Unnamed key") for a key without one, inserted as is between quotes, so no case ending or article can attach to it, and the sentence must read with either.
msgctxt "api_keys_delete_confirm_body"
msgid "\"{}\" will stop working right away, and anything using it will lose access."
msgstr "“{}” तुरंत काम करना बंद कर देगी, और इसका उपयोग करने वाली हर चीज़ की पहुँच खत्म हो जाएगी।"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): title of the confirmation before a key is deleted.
msgctxt "api_keys_delete_confirm_title"
msgid "Delete this API key?"
msgstr "यह API कुंजी डिलीट करें?"

#. API keys screen (Account > API keys): shown when deleting a key failed.
msgctxt "api_keys_delete_failed"
msgid "Couldn't delete the API key. Try again."
msgstr "API कुंजी डिलीट नहीं की जा सकी। पुनः प्रयास करें।"

