#. Used in Main/Account/Wallet/WalletView.swift.
msgctxt "bittensor"
msgid "Bittensor"
msgstr "Bittensor"

#. Title of the picker that chooses which Bittensor wallet (Talisman or TAO.com) signs.
msgctxt "bittensor_choose_wallet"
msgid "Choose your Bittensor wallet"
msgstr "अपना Bittensor वॉलेट चुनें"

#. Desktop: shown while the browser is open on the wallet page. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman).
msgctxt "bittensor_continue_in_browser"
msgid "Continue in your browser and approve the request in the {} extension."
msgstr "अपने ब्राउज़र में जारी रखें और {} एक्सटेंशन में अनुरोध को मंज़ूरी दें।"

#. Bittensor wallet error, on the ur.io wallet card and sign-in, and in the apps when the ur.io bridge page returns address_not_in_wallet: the chosen wallet does not offer the account of the address the user typed (Talisman does not hold it or has not connected it to the site; a WalletConnect wallet connected another account), so nothing was signed. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or WalletConnect).
msgctxt "bittensor_error_address_not_in_wallet"
msgid "Your {} wallet doesn't have the address you entered. Add or connect that account in the wallet, or enter an address it has."
msgstr "आपके {} वॉलेट में वह पता नहीं है जो आपने दर्ज किया है। उस खाते को वॉलेट में जोड़ें या कनेक्ट करें, या ऐसा पता दर्ज करें जो वॉलेट में हो।"

#. Error: the single-use wallet challenge expired (5 minutes) before it was signed.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_challenge_expired"
msgid "This request expired. Start again to get a new message to sign."
msgstr "यह अनुरोध समाप्त हो गया है। साइन करने के लिए नया संदेश पाने हेतु फिर से शुरू करें।"

#. Bittensor wallet error (ur.io, and the apps when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns extension_not_authorized): the browser extension has not allowed the site to use an account yet, so nothing was signed. The user rejected or closed the extension's connect window, has no Polkadot/Bittensor account in the extension, removed the site's accounts in the extension's connected sites, or a connect request is still open in it. Talisman says "Site <url> has not been authorised for Talisman yet"; polkadot{.js}, SubWallet and TAO.com say "The source <url> has not been enabled yet" or "is not allowed to interact with this extension". The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or TAO.com). "Connected Sites" is the extension's settings page that lists the sites allowed to use its accounts: use the extension's own name for it where it ships your language (Talisman: de Verbundene Seiten, es Sitios Conectados, ru Подключенные сайты, zh 连接网站); otherwise keep the English name, followed by a translation in parentheses.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_extension_not_authorized"
msgid "{} hasn't allowed ur.io to use your Bittensor account yet. Approve the connection request in the wallet, or allow ur.io under Connected Sites in its settings, then try again."
msgstr "{} ने अभी तक ur.io को आपका Bittensor खाता उपयोग करने की अनुमति नहीं दी है। वॉलेट में कनेक्शन अनुरोध स्वीकृत करें, या उसकी सेटिंग्स में “Connected Sites” (कनेक्ट की गई साइटें) के अंतर्गत ur.io को अनुमति दें, फिर से प्रयास करें।"

#. Error: the wallet's browser extension is not installed in this browser (on ur.io, or in the apps when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns extension_not_found). The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman on the Bittensor page, Phantom or Solflare on the Solana page).
msgctxt "bittensor_error_extension_not_found"
msgid "The {} extension was not found in this browser. Install it, then try again."
msgstr "इस ब्राउज़र में {} एक्सटेंशन नहीं मिला। इसे इंस्टॉल करें, फिर दोबारा प्रयास करें।"

#. Error: the pasted or returned Bittensor signature is not a 64-byte hex signature.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_invalid_signature"
msgid "That is not a valid signature. Paste the full 0x signature from your wallet."
msgstr "यह मान्य हस्ताक्षर नहीं है। अपने वॉलेट से पूरा 0x हस्ताक्षर पेस्ट करें।"

#. Error: the wallet returned a signature over a different challenge than the one issued.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_message_mismatch"
msgid "The wallet signed a different request. Start again."
msgstr "वॉलेट ने किसी दूसरे अनुरोध पर साइन किया। फिर से शुरू करें।"

#. Wallet error in the apps, when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns no_account: the chosen wallet shared no account it can sign with (none is connected to the site, or it holds only accounts of another chain), so nothing was signed. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or WalletConnect on the Bittensor page, Phantom or Solflare on the Solana page).
msgctxt "bittensor_error_no_account"
msgid "Your {} wallet has no account to sign with. Add or connect an account in the wallet, then try again."
msgstr "आपके {} वॉलेट में हस्ताक्षर करने के लिए कोई खाता नहीं है। वॉलेट में कोई खाता जोड़ें या कनेक्ट करें, फिर दोबारा प्रयास करें।"

#. Bittensor wallet connect (Earnings), manual entry (TAO.com, or Talisman on a phone): the server refused the pasted signature because it does not verify for the address the user typed over the shown message (POST /sn/wallet error.code signature_mismatch). Usually the user signed with another account in the wallet. The server cannot tell which account signed. The argument is the wallet product name (TAO.com or Talisman).
msgctxt "bittensor_error_signature_mismatch"
msgid "This signature isn't from the address you entered. In {}, sign the message with that address, then paste the signature again."
msgstr "यह हस्ताक्षर आपके दर्ज किए गए पते का नहीं है। {} में उस पते से संदेश पर हस्ताक्षर करें, फिर हस्ताक्षर दोबारा पेस्ट करें।"

#. Wallet error in the apps, when a ur.io wallet bridge page returns user_rejected: the user declined the connection or the signature request in the wallet, so nothing was signed. The Bittensor page (Talisman, or a WalletConnect wallet) and the Solana page of the desktop apps (Phantom or Solflare) both return it; on iOS, Phantom and Solflare decline with 4001, which reads the same.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_user_rejected"
msgid "The request was declined in your wallet. Start again and approve it to continue."
msgstr "आपके वॉलेट में अनुरोध अस्वीकार कर दिया गया। जारी रखने के लिए फिर से शुरू करें और अनुरोध को स्वीकृत करें।"

#. Bittensor wallet error in the apps, when the ur.io bridge page returns walletconnect_expired: the WalletConnect pairing or the signature request ran out of time before the wallet answered. WalletConnect is a product name.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_walletconnect_expired"
msgid "The WalletConnect request expired before the wallet answered. Start again."
msgstr "वॉलेट के जवाब देने से पहले WalletConnect अनुरोध की समय-सीमा समाप्त हो गई। फिर से शुरू करें।"

#. Bittensor wallet error in the apps, when the ur.io bridge page returns walletconnect_unavailable: the page has no WalletConnect project id, so it cannot pair a wallet. Manual entry still works. WalletConnect is a product name.
msgctxt "bittensor_error_walletconnect_unavailable"
msgid "WalletConnect is not available right now. Try again later, or enter your address manually."
msgstr "WalletConnect अभी उपलब्ध नहीं है। बाद में फिर से प्रयास करें, या अपना पता मैन्युअल रूप से दर्ज करें।"

#. The owner's disclaimer (2026-11-03), on every screen of the one-tap Bittensor key flows where the key is in this app's secure storage on the device: the payout card, the Key screen with its delete and keep confirmations, the claim card, and later convert and Top 200. Three sentences: the key is kept on the device in the app's own secure storage (use your language's usual words for an app's secure storage), it is never shared with URnetwork, and URnetwork does not touch and is not responsible for any user funds. Keep the meaning exact. The last sentence is also the key bittensor_funds_disclaimer_funds_only and must read exactly the same.
msgctxt "bittensor_funds_disclaimer"
msgid "This key is stored locally in the app secure storage. It is never shared with URnetwork. URnetwork does not touch and is not responsible for any user funds."
msgstr "यह कुंजी ऐप के सुरक्षित स्टोरेज में स्थानीय रूप से सेव रहती है। इसे कभी भी URnetwork के साथ शेयर नहीं किया जाता। URnetwork उपयोगकर्ताओं के किसी भी फ़ंड को नहीं छूता और उनके लिए ज़िम्मेदार नहीं है।"

#. The last sentence of the owner's disclaimer (bittensor_funds_disclaimer) alone, for the screens of the one-tap Bittensor key flows where the key is not stored in this app: a network paid to an outside wallet or a key on another device, a key this app has deleted, and a recovery phrase being saved before anything is stored. Must read exactly as the last sentence of bittensor_funds_disclaimer.
msgctxt "bittensor_funds_disclaimer_funds_only"
msgid "URnetwork does not touch and is not responsible for any user funds."
msgstr "URnetwork उपयोगकर्ताओं के किसी भी फ़ंड को नहीं छूता और उनके लिए ज़िम्मेदार नहीं है।"

#. The reason in the system's device authentication prompt (Face ID, Touch ID, passcode). macOS shows it after the app's name: 'URnetwork is trying to use your Bittensor recovery phrase'. iOS shows it alone. Write the phrase that reads naturally in both, in your language's form for a purpose, and start it in lower case where your language allows.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_auth_reason"
msgid "use your Bittensor recovery phrase"
msgstr "अपने Bittensor रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ का उपयोग करने के लिए"

#. Earnings screen: the title of a warning banner, and a button on the payout card. Both open the Key screen, where the user saves the recovery phrase.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_back_up"
msgid "Back up your key"
msgstr "अपनी कुंजी का बैकअप लें"

#. Sign out and Delete account confirmations: a button that opens the Key screen, so the user can save the recovery phrase before going on. Short: a button.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_back_up_first"
msgid "Back up first"
msgstr "पहले बैकअप लें"

#. Earnings screen: the warning banner under Back up your key, which stays until the phrase is saved.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_banner_body"
msgid "If you lose this device before saving your recovery phrase, your SN25α can't be reached."
msgstr "अगर आप अपना रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ सहेजने से पहले यह डिवाइस खो देते हैं, तो आपके SN25α तक पहुँचा नहीं जा सकेगा।"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. Shown while a screen recording or mirroring is running.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_capture_hidden"
msgid "The words stay hidden while your screen is being recorded or mirrored."
msgstr "जब तक आपकी स्क्रीन रिकॉर्ड या मिरर हो रही है, शब्द छिपे रहेंगे।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. The first line while the network has no payout wallet. Set up payouts is the main button below it.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_card_none"
msgid "No payout wallet yet. Earnings aren't paid until you set one up."
msgstr "अभी कोई पेआउट वॉलेट नहीं है। जब तक आप इसे सेट नहीं करते, कमाई का भुगतान नहीं होता।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. The key was made and stored, but the step that links it to payouts did not finish. The Finish setup button follows.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_card_not_linked"
msgid "Your key is on this device, but payouts aren't set up yet."
msgstr "आपकी कुंजी इस डिवाइस पर है, लेकिन भुगतान अभी सेट नहीं हुआ है।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. Payouts go to another wallet, and a key made earlier is still on this device.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_card_other_consent"
msgid "The key on this device isn't receiving payouts."
msgstr "इस डिवाइस की कुंजी पर भुगतान नहीं आ रहा है।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card before setup, under its title and above the Set up payouts button. Read before the one tap: what the tap does and the one risk. Set up payouts is the button's label; keep it recognizable as that label.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_card_short"
msgid "URnetwork is not a wallet. Set up payouts creates a Bittensor key on this device, and your whole network's SN25α is paid to it. Back up its recovery phrase: if you lose this device before saving it, your SN25α can't be reached."
msgstr "URnetwork वॉलेट नहीं है। “भुगतान सेट करें” इस डिवाइस पर एक Bittensor कुंजी बनाता है, और आपके पूरे नेटवर्क के SN25α का भुगतान उसी कुंजी पर होता है। कुंजी के रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ का बैकअप लें: अगर आप फ़्रेज़ सहेजने से पहले यह डिवाइस खो देते हैं, तो आपके SN25α तक पहुँचा नहीं जा सकेगा।"

#. The payout consent sheet when the network already pays a wallet (Change wallet): what changing does. An epoch is the subnet's payout period.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_change_wallet_body"
msgid "Choose where this network's earnings are paid from the next epoch. Earlier earnings stay where they were paid."
msgstr "चुनें कि अगले एपोक से इस नेटवर्क की कमाई का भुगतान कहाँ हो। पिछली कमाई वहीं रहेगी जहाँ उसका भुगतान हुआ था।"

#. Key screen, the confirmation before the key leaves the app, where the user enters two of its words. Top 200 is a ranking the network's miners can claim a place on.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_confirm_top200"
msgid "Deleting this key also gives up claiming a Top 200 spot with one tap. You could still claim from a Bittensor wallet holding this recovery phrase."
msgstr "इस कुंजी को डिलीट करने से एक टैप में टॉप 200 की जगह पक्की करने का विकल्प भी चला जाता है। आप फिर भी इस रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ वाले किसी Bittensor वॉलेट से जगह पक्की कर सकते हैं।"

#. Key screen, under the Copy button for the recovery phrase: a warning about the clipboard. The copy isn't shared to the user's other devices and is removed after 60 seconds; 60 s is 60 seconds, abbreviate seconds as usual.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_copy_warning_2"
msgid "Other apps may be able to read the clipboard. The copy stays on this device and is cleared after 60 s."
msgstr "हो सकता है कि दूसरे ऐप क्लिपबोर्ड पढ़ सकें। कॉपी इसी डिवाइस पर रहती है और 60 सेकंड बाद साफ़ कर दी जाती है।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. A small link when payouts go to another wallet. A warning follows before anything changes.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_create_here"
msgid "Create a key on this device"
msgstr "इस डिवाइस पर कुंजी बनाएं"

#. The payout consent sheet (Change wallet), under the button Create a key on this device: what it does.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_create_here_body"
msgid "URnetwork is not a wallet. One tap creates a Bittensor key on this device; back up its recovery phrase afterwards."
msgstr "URnetwork वॉलेट नहीं है। एक टैप से इस डिवाइस पर एक Bittensor कुंजी बन जाती है। उसके बाद उसके रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ का बैकअप लें।"

#. Delete account, the confirmation while this device holds the network's Bittensor key and its recovery phrase isn't saved. It is the key.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_delete_account_message_2"
msgid "Your Bittensor key isn't backed up. Deleting your account also deletes it from this device, and URnetwork can't get it back."
msgstr "आपकी Bittensor कुंजी का बैकअप नहीं लिया गया है। अकाउंट डिलीट करने पर यह इस डिवाइस से भी डिलीट हो जाएगी, और URnetwork इसे वापस नहीं ला सकता।"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. The one destructive button: the user says the phrase is saved, and the app may forget it.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_delete_action"
msgid "I have saved the key, it's OK to delete it now."
msgstr "मैंने कुंजी सहेज ली है, अब इसे डिलीट किया जा सकता है।"

#. Key screen, the delete confirmation: one point of a short list. The placeholder is the key's Bittensor address, shortened to its first and last characters around an ellipsis (5F3s…kQ9v); keep it as it is.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_delete_bullet_address"
msgid "Earnings keep going to this address, {}."
msgstr "कमाई इसी पते पर आती रहेगी, {}।"

#. Key screen, the delete confirmation: one point of a short list. Convert to TAO is the app's action that swaps SN25α for TAO with this key.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_delete_bullet_convert"
msgid "Convert to TAO stops working in this app."
msgstr "इस ऐप में TAO में बदलने की सुविधा काम करना बंद कर देगी।"

#. Key screen, the delete confirmation: one point of a short list.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_delete_bullet_no_recovery"
msgid "URnetwork can't get this key back."
msgstr "URnetwork यह कुंजी वापस नहीं ला सकता।"

#. Key screen, the delete confirmation: one point of a short list, after Earnings keep going to this address. Them is the earnings.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_delete_bullet_phrase"
msgid "Only the recovery phrase can move them."
msgstr "इसे केवल रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ से ही कहीं और ले जाया जा सकता है।"

#. Key screen, the confirmation before the key leaves the app, where the user enters two of its words. The destructive button.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_delete_confirm"
msgid "Delete key"
msgstr "कुंजी डिलीट करें"

#. Key screen, the title of the confirmation when the user saved the recovery phrase first: payouts get set up with the key, and then the app drops it.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_delete_save_now_title"
msgid "Set up payouts and delete the key?"
msgstr "भुगतान सेट करें और कुंजी डिलीट करें?"

#. Key screen, the title of the confirmation before this app deletes its copy of the Bittensor key. The user has said they saved the recovery phrase.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_delete_title_2"
msgid "Delete the key from this device?"
msgstr "कुंजी इस डिवाइस से डिलीट करें?"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card after this app deleted its copy of the key (the user saved the recovery phrase first). Earnings keep going to the same address. Top 200 is the leaderboard of the subnet's top 200 miners; keep it as the app writes it elsewhere.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_deleted_body"
msgid "Claims keep working. To transfer or convert your SN25α, or to claim a Top 200 spot, use a Bittensor wallet holding your recovery phrase."
msgstr "दावे काम करते रहेंगे। अपने SN25α को ट्रांसफ़र करने या बदलने के लिए, या टॉप 200 की जगह पक्की करने के लिए, ऐसे Bittensor वॉलेट का इस्तेमाल करें जिसमें आपका रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ हो।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. Payouts go to an address whose key is not in this app. The phrase cannot be shown here.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_elsewhere"
msgid "This key is on another device or in your wallet."
msgstr "यह कुंजी किसी दूसरे डिवाइस पर या आपके वॉलेट में है।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card, under This key is on another device or in your wallet: this app doesn't hold the key, so it can't show the key's recovery phrase.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_elsewhere_body"
msgid "Its recovery phrase can't be shown here."
msgstr "इसका रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ यहाँ नहीं दिखाया जा सकता।"

#. Key screen, the title of the sheet where the user types two words of the recovery phrase, to show it was saved.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_enter_two_words"
msgid "Enter two of the words"
msgstr "दो शब्द डालें"

#. Key screen, the two-word sheet before deleting the key: what to do. The fields below say which word, as Word 4.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_enter_two_words_body"
msgid "To confirm you've saved the recovery phrase, enter these two words from it."
msgstr "यह पुष्टि करने के लिए कि आपने रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ सहेज लिया है, उसके ये दो शब्द डालें।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card, under the Bittensor address the network's earnings go to. Every device (miner) the user runs on this network earns to it.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_every_device"
msgid "Every device on your network is paid to this address."
msgstr "आपके नेटवर्क के हर डिवाइस का भुगतान इसी पते पर होता है।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. A general error under the Set up payouts button.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_failure_consent"
msgid "Couldn't set up payouts. Try again."
msgstr "भुगतान सेट नहीं हो सका। दोबारा कोशिश करें।"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. An error after the user asked to delete the key.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_failure_delete"
msgid "Couldn't delete the key from this device. It's still here."
msgstr "इस डिवाइस से कुंजी डिलीट नहीं हो सकी। वह अभी भी यहीं है।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. An error under the Set up payouts button.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_failure_generate"
msgid "Couldn't make a key on this device. Try again."
msgstr "इस डिवाइस पर कुंजी नहीं बन सकी। दोबारा कोशिश करें।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. The device's secure storage did not answer, usually because the device is locked: Keychain on Apple, Keystore on Android, the credential store on a desktop. The same words on every platform, so name none of them.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_failure_keychain"
msgid "Couldn't read this device's secure storage. Unlock your device and try again."
msgstr "इस डिवाइस का सुरक्षित स्टोरेज पढ़ा नहीं जा सका। अपना डिवाइस अनलॉक करें और दोबारा कोशिश करें।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. An error under the Set up payouts button: the new key could not be written to the device's secure storage.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_failure_store"
msgid "Couldn't save the key on this device, so nothing was signed. Try again, or save the recovery phrase first."
msgstr "इस डिवाइस पर कुंजी सहेजी नहीं जा सकी, इसलिए कुछ भी साइन नहीं हुआ। दोबारा कोशिश करें, या पहले रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ सहेजें।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card when a key was stored but setup stopped before the payout consent was signed, for example after a crash. Finish setup is the button's label below; keep it recognizable as that label.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_finish_body"
msgid "Setup stopped before signing, so nothing was paid to this key. Finish setup signs the consent with it."
msgstr "साइन करने से पहले सेटअप रुक गया, इसलिए इस कुंजी पर कुछ भी भुगतान नहीं हुआ। “सेटअप पूरा करें” इसी कुंजी से सहमति पर साइन करता है।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. Button that retries the link between the key on this device and the network's payouts.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_finish_setup"
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "सेटअप पूरा करें"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. Button that covers the words again.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_hide"
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "छिपाएं"

#. Key screen, while the recovery phrase's words show: a countdown until they hide by themselves. The placeholder is minutes and seconds, as 0:58.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_hides_in"
msgid "Hides again in {}"
msgstr "{} बाद फिर से छिप जाएगा"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. A smaller link: the user says the phrase is saved, and the key stays on the device, so the reminders stop.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_keep_action"
msgid "I've saved it. Keep it on this device."
msgstr "मैंने इसे सहेज लिया है। इसे इसी डिवाइस पर रखें।"

#. Key screen, the keep sheet: what keeping does. Convert is the app's SN25α to TAO action; one-tap Top 200 is claiming a spot on the subnet's Top 200 leaderboard with one tap. Keep Top 200 as the app writes it.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_keep_body"
msgid "You've saved the recovery phrase, so the backup reminder ends. The key stays on this device for convert and one-tap Top 200."
msgstr "आपने रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ सहेज लिया है, इसलिए बैकअप रिमाइंडर बंद हो जाता है। TAO में बदलने और एक टैप में टॉप 200 की जगह पक्की करने के लिए कुंजी इस डिवाइस पर रहती है।"

#. Key screen, the keep sheet's button, enabled once the two words are right. Short: a button. It is the key that stays.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_keep_confirm_2"
msgid "Keep it on this device"
msgstr "इसे इस डिवाइस पर रखें"

#. Key screen, the keep sheet: what to do. The fields below say which word, as Word 4.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_keep_prompt"
msgid "To confirm, enter these two words from the phrase."
msgstr "पुष्टि करने के लिए, फ़्रेज़ के ये दो शब्द डालें।"

#. Key screen, the keep sheet when the user saved the recovery phrase first: the key gets stored on this device, and then the app sets up payouts with it. Convert is the SN25α to TAO action; keep Top 200 as the app writes it.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_keep_save_now_body"
msgid "You've saved the recovery phrase. The key is stored on this device for convert and one-tap Top 200, and then payouts are set up."
msgstr "आपने रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ सहेज लिया है। TAO में बदलने और एक टैप में टॉप 200 की जगह पक्की करने के लिए कुंजी इस डिवाइस पर सहेजी जाएगी, और फिर भुगतान सेट किया जाएगा।"

#. Key screen, the title of the sheet for keeping the Bittensor key on this device after the user saved its recovery phrase.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_keep_title_2"
msgid "Keep the key on this device?"
msgstr "कुंजी इस डिवाइस पर रखें?"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. A status line after the user saved the phrase and the app deleted its copy of the key.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_no_longer_here"
msgid "This app no longer has the key"
msgstr "इस ऐप के पास अब यह कुंजी नहीं है"

#. Key screen: tells apart the two phrases a user may have. The account seedphrase from sign-up (24 words) signs in to URnetwork; this Bittensor recovery phrase (12 words) controls the user's SN25α tokens. Use the app's usual words for each.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_not_seed_2"
msgid "Not the seedphrase from sign-up: that one is 24 words and signs you in to URnetwork. This Bittensor recovery phrase is 12 words and holds your SN25α."
msgstr "यह साइन-अप वाला सीड फ़्रेज़ नहीं है: वह 24 शब्दों का होता है और उससे आप URnetwork में साइन इन करते हैं। यह Bittensor रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ 12 शब्दों का है और आपके SN25α इसी में रहते हैं।"

#. The payout consent sheet (Change wallet), a heading above the list of Bittensor wallet apps, after the option to create a key on this device.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_or_choose_wallet"
msgid "Or choose your Bittensor wallet"
msgstr "या अपना Bittensor वॉलेट चुनें"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card's title once the network's earnings are being paid to its Bittensor key (from the first epoch after setup). Before that the title is Payouts start next epoch.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_payouts_on"
msgid "Payouts are on"
msgstr "भुगतान चालू हैं"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. A status line after setup. An epoch is the network's settlement period.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_payouts_start"
msgid "Payouts start next epoch"
msgstr "भुगतान अगले एपोक से शुरू होंगे"

#. The one local notification of an unsaved Bittensor key: the body. Tapping it opens the Key screen.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_reminder_body_2"
msgid "Back up your Bittensor recovery phrase now. If you lose this device before saving it, your SN25α can't be reached."
msgstr "अपने Bittensor रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ का अभी बैकअप लें। अगर आप फ़्रेज़ सहेजने से पहले यह डिवाइस खो देते हैं, तो आपके SN25α तक पहुँचा नहीं जा सकेगा।"

#. The one local notification, sent when the network's first earnings on the Bittensor key can be claimed while its recovery phrase still isn't saved: the title.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_reminder_title_2"
msgid "Your first SN25α is claimable"
msgstr "आपके पहले SN25α पर दावा किया जा सकता है"

#. The warning before a new key replaces the network's payout wallet: the button that goes ahead. Short: a button.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_replace_confirm"
msgid "Replace payout wallet"
msgstr "पेआउट वॉलेट बदलें"

#. Earnings screen, a warning before a new key on this device replaces the network's payout wallet.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_replace_message"
msgid "This key replaces your payout wallet from the next epoch. Earlier earnings stay on the old wallet."
msgstr "यह कुंजी अगले एपोक से आपके पेआउट वॉलेट की जगह ले लेगी। पिछली कमाई पुराने वॉलेट में ही रहेगी।"

#. The warning before a new key on this device replaces the network's payout wallet. The placeholder is the old wallet's Bittensor address, shortened (5F3s…kQ9v); keep it as it is.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_replace_message_2"
msgid "From the next epoch, your network's earnings go to a new key on this device. Earlier earnings stay on {}. The network admin gets an email about this change."
msgstr "अगले एपोक से आपके नेटवर्क की कमाई इस डिवाइस की एक नई कुंजी पर जाएगी। पिछली कमाई {} पर ही रहेगी। नेटवर्क एडमिन को इस बदलाव के बारे में एक ईमेल मिलेगा।"

#. Earnings screen, the title of a warning before a new key on this device replaces the network's payout wallet.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_replace_title"
msgid "Replace your payout wallet?"
msgstr "अपना पेआउट वॉलेट बदलें?"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. The words are covered, and this is on the cover.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_reveal"
msgid "Tap to reveal"
msgstr "दिखाने के लिए टैप करें"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. A smaller link under Set up payouts: shows the phrase to save before anything else happens.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_save_first"
msgid "Save the recovery phrase first"
msgstr "पहले रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ सहेजें"

#. Key screen, a banner at the top when the user chose to save the recovery phrase first: the key exists only in memory. The 12 words are the recovery phrase. Below are two choices: keep the key on this device, or set up payouts and delete it.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_save_now_banner"
msgid "This key isn't saved on this device. Write the 12 words down, then choose below. If you leave this screen, the key is discarded and nothing is paid to it."
msgstr "यह कुंजी इस डिवाइस पर सहेजी नहीं गई है। 12 शब्द लिख लें, फिर नीचे से चुनें। अगर आप यह स्क्रीन छोड़ते हैं, तो कुंजी हटा दी जाएगी और उस पर कोई भुगतान नहीं होगा।"

#. Key screen, the confirmation when the user saved the recovery phrase first: one point of a short list. The placeholder is the key's Bittensor address, shortened (5F3s…kQ9v); keep it as it is. An epoch is the subnet's payout period.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_save_now_bullet_address"
msgid "Payouts go to this address, {}, from the next epoch."
msgstr "अगले एपोक से भुगतान इस पते {} पर भेजे जाएंगे।"

#. Key screen, the confirmation when the user saved the recovery phrase first: one point of a short list. Convert to TAO is the app's action that swaps SN25α for TAO.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_save_now_bullet_convert"
msgid "Convert to TAO needs this key, so it won't be available in this app."
msgstr "TAO में बदलने की सुविधा को यह कुंजी चाहिए, इसलिए यह सुविधा इस ऐप में उपलब्ध नहीं होगी।"

#. Key screen, the confirmation when the user saved the recovery phrase first: one point of a short list.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_save_now_bullet_phrase"
msgid "Only the recovery phrase can move your SN25α."
msgstr "केवल रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ से ही आपके SN25α को कहीं और ले जाया जा सकता है।"

#. Key screen, the button that sets up payouts with the key and then drops it, after the user entered two words of the recovery phrase. Short: a button.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_save_now_delete_confirm"
msgid "Set up payouts and delete key"
msgstr "भुगतान सेट करें और कुंजी डिलीट करें"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. After the link to payouts failed, for a key that exists only in memory. A Retry button follows.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_save_now_retry"
msgid "Payouts aren't set up yet. No earnings went to this key, and leaving discards it."
msgstr "भुगतान अभी सेट नहीं हुआ है। इस कुंजी पर कोई कमाई नहीं आई है, और यहाँ से जाने पर यह हटा दी जाएगी।"

#. Key screen, a small heading above the two choices for after the user has written the recovery phrase down: keep the key on this device, or delete it.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_saved_question"
msgid "Saved the recovery phrase?"
msgstr "रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ सहेज लिया?"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. The screen's title.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_screen_title"
msgid "Bittensor recovery phrase"
msgstr "Bittensor रिकवरी फ़्रेज़"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. Shown after the user took a screenshot of the screen.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_screenshot_warning"
msgid "If that screenshot shows your recovery phrase, delete it. Anyone with this phrase controls your SN25α."
msgstr "अगर उस स्क्रीनशॉट में आपका रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ दिख रहा है, तो स्क्रीनशॉट डिलीट करें। जिसके पास भी यह फ़्रेज़ है, वह आपके SN25α को नियंत्रित करता है।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. The main button: one tap makes the key, stores it on the device and links it to payouts.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_set_up"
msgid "Set up payouts"
msgstr "भुगतान सेट करें"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card: under the Set up payouts button while it works, which takes a few seconds. The app writes the new key to the device's secure storage, reads it back to check it, and then signs the payout consent with it.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_setting_up"
msgid "Saving the key on this device and reading it back, then signing."
msgstr "इस डिवाइस पर कुंजी सहेजी जा रही है और दोबारा पढ़ी जा रही है, फिर साइन किया जाएगा।"

#. The confirmation of Sign out, the message.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_sign_out_message"
msgid "Your Bittensor recovery phrase isn't saved yet. The key stays on this device and comes back when this network signs in again. If you lose this device before saving it, your SN25α can't be reached."
msgstr "आपका Bittensor रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ अभी सहेजा नहीं गया है। कुंजी इसी डिवाइस पर रहती है और जब यह नेटवर्क फिर से साइन इन करता है तो वापस आ जाती है। अगर आप फ़्रेज़ सहेजने से पहले यह डिवाइस खो देते हैं, तो आपके SN25α तक पहुँचा नहीं जा सकेगा।"

#. Sign out, the confirmation while the Bittensor key's recovery phrase isn't saved: what happens to the key. It is the key.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_sign_out_message_2"
msgid "It stays on this device and comes back when you sign in to this network again. If you lose this device before saving it, your SN25α can't be reached."
msgstr "कुंजी इसी डिवाइस पर रहती है और जब आप इस नेटवर्क में फिर से साइन इन करते हैं तो वापस आ जाती है। अगर आप इसे सहेजने से पहले यह डिवाइस खो देते हैं, तो आपके SN25α तक पहुँचा नहीं जा सकेगा।"

#. Sign out, the confirmation while this device holds the network's Bittensor key and its recovery phrase isn't saved: the title.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_sign_out_title_2"
msgid "Your Bittensor key isn't backed up"
msgstr "आपकी Bittensor कुंजी का बैकअप नहीं लिया गया है"

#. Key screen, a banner with a spinner while the app signs the network's payout consent with the new key, after the user confirmed two words of the recovery phrase.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_signing"
msgid "Setting up payouts: signing your network's payout consent with this key."
msgstr "भुगतान सेट किए जा रहे हैं: इस कुंजी से आपके नेटवर्क की पेआउट सहमति पर साइन किया जा रहा है।"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card: a status line beside a green dot. The Bittensor key is stored on this device and the user confirmed saving its recovery phrase.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_status_saved"
msgid "Key on this device, recovery phrase saved"
msgstr "कुंजी इस डिवाइस पर है, रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ सहेज लिया गया"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card: a status line beside an amber dot. The Bittensor key is stored on this device and the user hasn't confirmed saving its recovery phrase.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_status_unsaved"
msgid "Key on this device, not backed up yet"
msgstr "कुंजी इस डिवाइस पर है, अभी बैकअप नहीं लिया गया"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card for the network's payouts. A smaller link under Set up payouts: for someone who already has a Bittensor wallet.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_use_wallet"
msgid "Use a wallet I already have"
msgstr "मेरे पास पहले से मौजूद वॉलेट इस्तेमाल करें"

#. Earnings screen, the payout card: a link that opens the Key screen, where the recovery phrase can be shown after device authentication.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_view"
msgid "View key"
msgstr "कुंजी देखें"

#. Key screen, the confirmation before the key leaves the app, where the user enters two of its words. A field label: which word of the phrase to enter, counting from 1, for example Word 3.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_word_number"
msgid "Word {}"
msgstr "शब्द {}"

#. Key screen, the two-word sheet: an error under a field whose word is wrong. The placeholder is the word's position in the phrase, counting from 1.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_word_wrong"
msgid "That isn't word {} of this recovery phrase."
msgstr "यह इस रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ का शब्द {} नहीं है।"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. Always visible on the screen.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_wording_control"
msgid "Anyone with this phrase controls your SN25α. URnetwork will never ask for it, and can't recover it. If you lose this device before saving it, your SN25α can't be reached."
msgstr "जिसके पास भी यह फ़्रेज़ है, वह आपके SN25α को नियंत्रित करता है। URnetwork इसे कभी नहीं माँगेगा, और इसे वापस नहीं ला सकता। अगर आप फ़्रेज़ सहेजने से पहले यह डिवाइस खो देते हैं, तो आपके SN25α तक पहुँचा नहीं जा सकेगा।"

#. Key screen: the screen that shows the Bittensor recovery phrase, a 12 word secret for a key this app made on the device. Always visible on the screen.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_wording_not_wallet"
msgid "URnetwork is not a wallet. It created this key so you can receive SN25α. To transfer or use your SN25α, enter this recovery phrase into a Bittensor wallet such as Talisman or Nova, or into btcli."
msgstr "URnetwork वॉलेट नहीं है। इसने यह कुंजी इसलिए बनाई है ताकि आप SN25α प्राप्त कर सकें। अपने SN25α को ट्रांसफ़र करने या इस्तेमाल करने के लिए, यह रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ Talisman या Nova जैसे किसी Bittensor वॉलेट में, या btcli में डालें।"

#. Key screen, a small label above the recovery phrase's words: that it has 12 words, and the key's Bittensor address, shortened to its first and last characters around an ellipsis (5F3s…kQ9v); keep the address as it is.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_words_label"
msgid "12 words · address {}"
msgstr "12 शब्द · पता {}"

#. Key screen, the confirmation before the key leaves the app, where the user enters two of its words. An error under the two fields.
msgctxt "bittensor_key_words_rejected"
msgid "Those words don't match. Check your saved recovery phrase."
msgstr "ये शब्द मेल नहीं खाते। अपना सहेजा हुआ रिकवरी फ़्रेज़ जाँचें।"

#. The manual signing option in a Bittensor wallet chooser: on ur.io its own entry, and in the phone apps the line under a wallet that has no way to sign here directly. The user signs a message outside the page or app, for example with the btcli command line tool, and pastes the signature back.
msgctxt "bittensor_manual_choice"
msgid "Sign manually"
msgstr "मैन्युअल रूप से हस्ताक्षर करें"

#. First line of the manual signing form, on ur.io and in the apps' sheet. Support inbox 8167: a user waited for a wallet window that never comes on this path.
msgctxt "bittensor_manual_no_popup"
msgid "No wallet window opens for this. You sign the message yourself, then paste the signature below."
msgstr "इसके लिए कोई वॉलेट विंडो नहीं खुलेगी। आप संदेश पर स्वयं हस्ताक्षर करें, फिर हस्ताक्षर नीचे चिपकाएँ।"

#. The phone apps' manual signing sheet: what to do when the wallet can't sign a pasted message. WalletConnect and Nova are product names, and ur.io/app/account/earnings is a web address: keep them as they are.
msgctxt "bittensor_manual_phone_route"
msgid "If your wallet can't sign a pasted message, go back and choose WalletConnect (Nova and others), or sign at ur.io/app/account/earnings in a computer's browser."
msgstr "यदि आपका वॉलेट चिपकाए गए संदेश पर हस्ताक्षर नहीं कर सकता, तो वापस जाएँ और WalletConnect (Nova और अन्य) चुनें, या कंप्यूटर के ब्राउज़र में ur.io/app/account/earnings पर हस्ताक्षर करें।"

#. Manual Bittensor wallet proof: how to sign the shown challenge message. The argument is the wallet product name (Talisman or TAO.com).
msgctxt "bittensor_manual_sign_instructions"
msgid "Sign this message with the {} wallet that holds your coldkey, then paste the address and the signature below."
msgstr "इस संदेश पर उस {} वॉलेट से साइन करें जिसमें आपकी coldkey है, फिर नीचे पता और हस्ताक्षर पेस्ट करें।"

#. Label above the challenge message the user signs in their Bittensor wallet.
msgctxt "bittensor_message_to_sign"
msgid "Message to sign"
msgstr "साइन करने के लिए संदेश"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "bittensor_sign_in"
msgid "Sign in with Bittensor"
msgstr "Bittensor से साइन इन करें"

#. Label of the field where the user pastes the Bittensor wallet signature.
msgctxt "bittensor_signature_label"
msgid "Signature"
msgstr "हस्ताक्षर"

#. Placeholder of the Bittensor signature field (a 0x-prefixed hex signature).
msgctxt "bittensor_signature_placeholder"
msgid "Paste the 0x… signature"
msgstr "0x… हस्ताक्षर पेस्ट करें"

#. Label of the connected wallet block.
msgctxt "bittensor_wallet"
msgid "Bittensor wallet"
msgstr "Bittensor वॉलेट"

#. Shown while the browser is open on the WalletConnect page: the user scans the code or opens their wallet app there.
msgctxt "bittensor_walletconnect_continue"
msgid "Continue in your browser: scan the code with your wallet app, or open the wallet on this device."
msgstr "अपने ब्राउज़र में जारी रखें: अपने वॉलेट ऐप से कोड स्कैन करें, या इस डिवाइस पर वॉलेट खोलें।"

#. Subtitle of the WalletConnect option in the Bittensor wallet chooser: which wallets it works with. Nova, Nightly and WalletConnect are product names.
msgctxt "bittensor_walletconnect_hint"
msgid "Nova, Nightly and other WalletConnect wallets"
msgstr "Nova, Nightly और अन्य WalletConnect वॉलेट"

#. DNS settings: heading of the group of adblock providers that block ads and trackers (AdGuard DNS, Control D, DNS4EU), beside "Block malware" and "Family". Screens that haven't moved to dns_builtin_blocker_label also label URnetwork's own blocker's toggle with it, so it reads both as a heading and as an action.
msgctxt "block_ads_and_trackers"
msgid "Block ads and trackers"
msgstr "विज्ञापन और ट्रैकर ब्लॉक करें"

#. Label for the blocked traffic relayed for remote clients.
msgctxt "blocked"
msgid "Blocked"
msgstr "अवरुद्ध"

#. Blocked locations: blocking a location failed. The argument is the location name.
msgctxt "blocked_location_block_failed"
msgid "Couldn't block {}. Please try again."
msgstr "{} को ब्लॉक नहीं किया जा सका। कृपया दोबारा कोशिश करें।"

#. Used in Main/Account/BlockedLocations/BlockedLocationsViewModel.swift.
msgctxt "blocked_location_could_not_be_added_please_try"
msgid "Blocked location could not be added. Please try again later."
msgstr "अवरुद्ध स्थान जोड़ा नहीं जा सका। कृपया बाद में पुनः प्रयास करें।"

#. Used in Main/Account/BlockedLocations/BlockedLocationsViewModel.swift.
msgctxt "blocked_location_could_not_be_removed_please_try"
msgid "Blocked location could not be removed. Please try again later."
msgstr "अवरुद्ध स्थान हटाया नहीं जा सका। कृपया बाद में पुनः प्रयास करें।"

#. Blocked locations: unblocking a location failed, so it is back in the list. The argument is the location name.
msgctxt "blocked_location_unblock_failed"
msgid "Couldn't unblock {}. Please try again."
msgstr "{} को अनब्लॉक नहीं किया जा सका। कृपया दोबारा कोशिश करें।"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "blocked_locations"
msgid "Blocked Locations"
msgstr "अवरुद्ध स्थान"

#. Used in Main/Account/Settings/SettingsForm-iOS.swift.
msgctxt "blocked_locations_2"
msgid "Blocked locations"
msgstr "अवरुद्ध स्थान"

#. Shown on the Blocked locations screen when the list could not be fetched, above a Retry button.
msgctxt "blocked_locations_could_not_be_loaded"
msgid "Blocked locations could not be loaded."
msgstr "अवरुद्ध स्थान लोड नहीं हो सके।"

#. Blocked locations: the list could not be loaded.
msgctxt "blocked_locations_load_failed"
msgid "Couldn't load your blocked locations. Pull down to try again."
msgstr "आपकी ब्लॉक की गई लोकेशन लोड नहीं हो सकीं। दोबारा कोशिश करने के लिए नीचे खींचें।"

#. macOS Blocked locations screen: placeholder of the country search field.
msgctxt "blocked_locations_search_placeholder"
msgid "Search countries"
msgstr "देश खोजें"

#. Points leaderboard: stat tile label and sort chip. A block is one finalized payout epoch.
msgctxt "blocks"
msgid "Blocks"
msgstr "ब्लॉक"

#. Snackbar shown after copying the bonus referral code. Used in Shared/Views/Introduction/ParticipateReferView.swift, Main/Account/Settings/SettingsForm-iOS.swift and Main/Account/Settings/SettingsForm-macOS.swift.
msgctxt "bonus_referral_code_copied_to_clipboard"
msgid "Bonus referral code copied to clipboard"
msgstr "बोनस रेफरल कोड क्लिपबोर्ड पर कॉपी किया गया"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "bonus_referral_code_label"
msgid "Bonus referral code"
msgstr "बोनस रेफ़रल कोड"

#. A description of how users can earn more data by referring friends.
msgctxt "boost_bandwidth_details"
msgid "You get free data every month, and can earn more by referring friends."
msgstr "नेटवर्क में भाग लेकर और बैंडविड्थ प्रदान करके आप पुरस्कार कमा सकते हैं।"

#. A title for the introductory usage bar.
msgctxt "boost_your_bandwidth"
msgid "Boost Your Bandwidth"
msgstr "अपनी बैंडविड्थ बढ़ाएँ"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "browse_locations"
msgid "Browse Locations"
msgstr "स्थान ब्राउज़ करें"

#. Onboarding Carousel
msgctxt "build_right"
msgid "Build the\ninternet the\nright way"
msgstr "इंटरनेट को\nसही तरीके से बनाएं"

#. Onboarding Carousel
msgctxt "build_right_description"
msgid "Build the internet the right way with URnetwork"
msgstr "URnetwork के साथ इंटरनेट को सही तरीके से बनाएं"

#. Used in Shared/Views/Introduction/IntroductionUsageBar.swift.
msgctxt "by_default_you_get_10_gib_month_here_s_how_you"
msgid "By default you get 10 GiB/month. Here's how you can earn extra bandwidth:"
msgstr "डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से आपको 10 GiB/माह मिलता है। ऐसे आप अतिरिक्त बैंडविड्थ कमा सकते हैं:"

#. Used in Shared/Views/UpgradeSubscriptionSheet.swift.
msgctxt "by_subscribing_you_agree_to_urnetwork_s_terms"
msgid "By subscribing, you agree to URnetwork's [Terms and Services](https://ur.io/terms) and [Privacy Policy](https://ur.io/privacy)"
msgstr "सदस्यता लेने पर, आप URnetwork के [नियम और सेवाएँ](https://ur.io/terms) और [गोपनीयता नीति](https://ur.io/privacy) से सहमत हैं"

#. App split rules: rule choice sending the app around the VPN (local route).
msgctxt "bypass_vpn"
msgid "Bypass VPN"
msgstr "VPN बायपास करें"

#. Shown when the camera permission was denied on the scan screen.
msgctxt "camera_permission_needed"
msgid "Camera access is needed to scan a code."
msgstr "कोड स्कैन करने के लिए कैमरा एक्सेस ज़रूरी है।"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "cancel"
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "रद्द करें"

#. Shown when the app cannot reach the URnetwork platform; tapping it opens the Connection region picker.
msgctxt "cant_reach_urnetwork_choose_region"
msgid "Can't reach URnetwork — choose where you're connecting from"
msgstr "URnetwork तक नहीं पहुँच सके — चुनें कि आप कहाँ से कनेक्ट कर रहे हैं"

#. Error when the subnet RPC cannot be reached.
msgctxt "chain_rpc_unreachable"
msgid "The chain RPC is unreachable. Try again."
msgstr "चेन RPC तक नहीं पहुँचा जा सकता। दोबारा कोशिश करें।"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "change"
msgid "Change"
msgstr "बदलें"

#. Button that opens the network API selector, for pointing the app at a custom network domain.
msgctxt "change_network_api"
msgid "Change Network API"
msgstr "नेटवर्क API बदलें"

#. Title of the network API selector dialog.
msgctxt "change_network_api_title"
msgid "Change Network API"
msgstr "नेटवर्क API बदलें"

#. A description of the action to change the user's network name.
msgctxt "change_network_name_hint"
msgid "Tap the edit icon to change your network name"
msgstr "अपना नेटवर्क नाम बदलने के लिए संपादन आइकॉन पर टैप करें"

#. Profile
msgctxt "change_password"
msgid "Change Password"
msgstr "पासवर्ड बदलें"

#. Locations List
msgctxt "check_internet"
msgid "Check your internet connection"
msgstr "अपना इंटरनेट कनेक्शन जांचें"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "check_ip"
msgid "Check my IP"
msgstr "मेरा IP जांचें"

#. Forgot password
msgctxt "check_junk_mail"
msgid "You may need to check your spam folder or unblock support@ur.io"
msgstr "आपको अपना स्पैम फ़ोल्डर जांचना पड़ सकता है या support@ur.io को अनब्लॉक करना पड़ सकता है"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "checking_payment"
msgid "Checking payment"
msgstr "भुगतान की जांच हो रही है"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "checking_solana_transactions"
msgid "Checking for Solana Transactions"
msgstr "Solana लेन-देन की जांच हो रही है"

#. Progress text while the address is validated.
msgctxt "checking_wallet_address"
msgid "Checking address…"
msgstr "पता जाँचा जा रहा है…"

#. Upgrade sheet: the system browser could not be opened for the hosted checkout url. The app appends the url itself on the next line (selectable) so the user can copy it into a browser by hand — never advancing to the waiting page with no payment page open.
msgctxt "checkout_browser_launch_failed"
msgid "We couldn't open your browser. Copy this link into a browser to finish checkout:"
msgstr "हम आपका ब्राउज़र नहीं खोल सके। चेकआउट पूरा करने के लिए यह लिंक किसी ब्राउज़र में कॉपी करें:"

#. Purchase confirmation message while the app waits for the payment to be confirmed.
msgctxt "checkout_confirming_purchase"
msgid "We're confirming your purchase. Your plan will update automatically."
msgstr "हम आपकी खरीद की पुष्टि कर रहे हैं। आपका प्लान अपने आप अपडेट हो जाएगा।"

#. Checkout error in the desktop apps (the macOS direct download, Windows and Linux) when the ur.io checkout page hands back stripe_unavailable: Stripe's payment form could not be loaded in the checkout page (usually no internet connection, or a network that blocks it). Nothing was charged.
msgctxt "checkout_error_payment_form_unavailable"
msgid "The payment form couldn't load. Check your internet connection, then try again."
msgstr "भुगतान फ़ॉर्म लोड नहीं हो सका। अपना इंटरनेट कनेक्शन जांचें, फिर दोबारा प्रयास करें।"

#. Checkout error in the desktop apps (the macOS direct download, Windows and Linux) when the ur.io checkout page hands back checkout_unavailable, or the server refuses to start a checkout with error.code checkout_unavailable: the site or the server cannot open Stripe's checkout right now (it has no Stripe key), so no payment form was shown and nothing was charged. The user cannot fix it; it may work later.
msgctxt "checkout_error_unavailable"
msgid "Checkout isn't available right now. Please try again later."
msgstr "चेकआउट अभी उपलब्ध नहीं है। कृपया बाद में फिर से प्रयास करें।"

#. Purchase confirmation title after the app opened Stripe's checkout page in the browser.
msgctxt "checkout_finish_in_browser"
msgid "Finish in your browser."
msgstr "अपने ब्राउज़र में पूरा करें।"

#. Upgrade sheet waiting page: the embedded checkout webview crashed after the payment form had rendered, so a charge may already have gone through with only the redirect lost. Shown while the confirmation poll asks the server for the payment webhook; must never invite buying again.
msgctxt "checkout_interrupted_confirming"
msgid "The checkout view closed unexpectedly. If your payment went through, your plan updates here automatically — there's no need to buy again."
msgstr "चेकआउट व्यू अचानक बंद हो गया। अगर आपका भुगतान हो गया है, तो आपका प्लान यहाँ अपने-आप अपडेट हो जाएगा — दोबारा खरीदने की ज़रूरत नहीं है।"

#. Shown after the app hands the user to the Stripe hosted checkout in the system browser. The app polls the server and flips the plan automatically when the payment webhook lands.
msgctxt "checkout_opened_in_browser"
msgid "Complete your purchase in the browser. Your plan updates here automatically once payment is confirmed."
msgstr "ब्राउज़र में अपनी खरीदारी पूरी करें। भुगतान की पुष्टि होते ही आपकी योजना यहां अपने आप अपडेट हो जाएगी।"

#. Message after Restore purchases in the Stripe-paid app: nothing to restore locally, the app re-reads the plan from the server.
msgctxt "checkout_restore_checking"
msgid "Checking your plan again."
msgstr "आपका प्लान फिर से जाँचा जा रहा है।"

#. Button on desktop: pick a file that contains a QR code image.
msgctxt "choose_file"
msgid "Choose file"
msgstr "फ़ाइल चुनें"

#. Button on desktop: pick an image file that contains a QR code.
msgctxt "choose_image_file"
msgid "Choose image file"
msgstr "इमेज फ़ाइल चुनें"

#. Button: pick a photo that contains a QR code.
msgctxt "choose_photo"
msgid "Choose photo"
msgstr "फ़ोटो चुनें"

#. Provider list group title for cities
msgctxt "cities"
msgid "Cities"
msgstr "शहर"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "claim"
msgid "Claim"
msgstr "दावा करें"

#. Under the unclaimed SN25α total, on the Unclaimed tile and in the claim dialog: how many epochs that total comes from. It counts the claimable epochs only (finalized epochs that are claimed, expired or have no payout are not in it), so it never says finalized. The count follows its label, so the line reads with any number without a plural key.
msgctxt "claim_across_epochs"
msgid "Claimable epochs: {}"
msgstr "दावा योग्य एपोक: {}"

#. Title of the claim dialog.
msgctxt "claim_alpha_title"
msgid "Claim SN25α"
msgstr "SN25α का दावा करें"

#. Claim button with the amount.
msgctxt "claim_amount_button"
msgid "Claim {}"
msgstr "{} का दावा करें"

#. Claim state: confirmed on chain.
msgctxt "claim_confirmed"
msgid "Claimed"
msgstr "दावा किया गया"

#. Claim state: past the vault's expiry block.
msgctxt "claim_expired"
msgid "Expired"
msgstr "समाप्त"

#. Claim state: failed.
msgctxt "claim_failed"
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "विफल"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "claim_multiplier"
msgid "Claim Multiplier"
msgstr "गुणक का दावा करें"

#. A description of the benefits of claiming a custom network name.
msgctxt "claim_network_name_hint"
msgid "Claim a custom network name to replace your auto-generated one"
msgstr "अपने-आप बने नाम की जगह लेने के लिए कस्टम नेटवर्क नाम चुनें"

#. Per-epoch status while the claim transaction is being sent.
msgctxt "claim_sending_linux"
msgid "Sending…"
msgstr "भेजा जा रहा है…"

#. Explainer under the claim button.
msgctxt "claim_sends_from_device"
msgid "Your device sends the claim to the vault contract. Gas is paid in TAO from your gas key. Alpha lands on your coldkey."
msgstr "आपका डिवाइस दावा वॉल्ट कॉन्ट्रैक्ट को भेजता है। गैस का भुगतान आपकी गैस कुंजी से TAO में होता है। Alpha आपकी coldkey पर पहुँचता है।"

#. Claim state: transaction sent.
msgctxt "claim_sent"
msgid "Sent"
msgstr "भेजा गया"

#. Destination line on the claim dialog: the coldkey the alpha lands on.
msgctxt "claim_to_address_linux"
msgid "To {}"
msgstr "{} को"

#. Shown when the device cannot send claims (no gas key on this host).
msgctxt "claim_unavailable_linux"
msgid "Claiming is not available on this device yet."
msgstr "इस डिवाइस पर अभी दावा करना उपलब्ध नहीं है।"

#. Button on the Top 200 tile.
msgctxt "claim_your_spot"
msgid "Claim your spot"
msgstr "अपनी जगह पक्की करें"

#. Error when an epoch can no longer be claimed.
msgctxt "claims_for_epoch_expired"
msgid "Claims for epoch {} have expired."
msgstr "एपोक {} के दावे समाप्त हो गए हैं।"

#. Explainer in the claim dialog and on the unclaimed tile. No durations: the claim-open time and the expiry come from the chain's epoch schedule (sn_payout_schedule_times), so the copy never fixes the 48-hour finalize offset or the nine-epoch claim window.
msgctxt "claims_open_after_finalization"
msgid "Each epoch's claims open after its payout list is finalized and stay open until they expire."
msgstr "हर एपोक के दावे उसकी भुगतान सूची अंतिम होने के बाद खुलते हैं और समाप्त होने तक खुले रहते हैं।"

#. General UI string: a button that clears a field or setting.
msgctxt "clear"
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "साफ़ करें"

#. transfer stats and split rules
msgctxt "client_contracts"
msgid "Client contracts"
msgstr "क्लाइंट कॉन्ट्रैक्ट"

#. Used in Main/Account/Settings/SettingsForm-iOS.swift.
msgctxt "client_id"
msgid "Client ID"
msgstr "क्लाइंट ID"

#. transfer stats and split rules
msgctxt "client_id_copied"
msgid "Client ID copied"
msgstr "क्लाइंट ID कॉपी किया गया"

#. Used in Main/Account/Settings/SettingsForm-iOS.swift.
msgctxt "client_id_copied_to_clipboard"
msgid "Client ID copied to clipboard"
msgstr "क्लाइंट ID क्लिपबोर्ड पर कॉपी किया गया"

#. Title of the in-app notice and of the local notification shown while the platform holds this device off because the account network already has its plan's most devices connected at once (the concurrent client limit). The device does not connect until a slot frees, the user upgrades, or the hold ends; the user's traffic stays in the tunnel. Short, like a heading.
msgctxt "client_limit_reached"
msgid "Device limit reached"
msgstr "डिवाइस की सीमा पूरी हो गई"

#. Body under client_limit_reached, in the app and in the local notification, for a UR Pro account: it already has as many devices connected at once as its plan allows, the highest plan, so no upgrade helps. Signing out on another device frees its slot; Retry is the button beside it. Also shown when a sign-in on a new device is refused for the same limit. Keep URnetwork as it is.
msgctxt "client_limit_remove_client_message"
msgid "Your plan's limit of devices connected at once is reached. Sign out of URnetwork on a device you no longer use, then try again."
msgstr "आपके प्लान में एक साथ कनेक्ट डिवाइस की सीमा पूरी हो गई है। जिस डिवाइस का अब इस्तेमाल नहीं करते, उस पर URnetwork से साइन आउट करें, फिर दोबारा कोशिश करें।"

#. Body under client_limit_reached, in the app and in the local notification, for an account on the free plan: it already has as many devices connected at once as the free plan allows, so this device cannot connect. UR Pro allows more; Get Pro is the button beside it. Also shown when a sign-in on a new device is refused for the same limit. Keep UR Pro and URnetwork as they are.
msgctxt "client_limit_upgrade_message"
msgid "Your free plan connects a limited number of devices at once. Upgrade to UR Pro to connect more, or disconnect URnetwork on another device."
msgstr "आपका मुफ़्त प्लान एक साथ सीमित संख्या में डिवाइस कनेक्ट करता है। और डिवाइस कनेक्ट करने के लिए UR Pro में अपग्रेड करें, या किसी दूसरे डिवाइस पर URnetwork डिस्कनेक्ट करें।"

#. Title of a card that shows statistics about the client's network usage.
msgctxt "client_statistics"
msgid "Client statistics"
msgstr "क्लाइंट आँकड़े"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "clients"
msgid "Clients"
msgstr "क्लाइंट्स"

#. Billing errors. Every one is shown to the user WITH a remedy: a payment error they cannot see is a payment error they will hit again.
msgctxt "close"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "बंद करें"

#. Used in Main/Account/TransferBalanceCodes/TransferBalanceCodesView.swift.
msgctxt "code"
msgid "Code"
msgstr "कोड"

#. Error shown when signing in with an auth code fails.
msgctxt "code_sign_in_failed"
msgid "Code sign in failed"
msgstr "कोड से साइन इन विफल"

#. Screen reader state of a row that shows or hides a section below it (Advanced, Why?): the section is hidden. The counterpart of expanded.
msgctxt "collapsed"
msgid "Collapsed"
msgstr "संक्षिप्त"

#. Login initial
msgctxt "commitment_issues"
msgid "Commitment issues?"
msgstr "प्रतिबद्धता संबंधी समस्याएं?"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "community_edition"
msgid "Community Edition"
msgstr "कम्युनिटी एडिशन"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "community_edition_details"
msgid "Get free access to the community edition."
msgstr "नेटवर्क में भाग लें और कम्युनिटी एडिशन तक मुफ्त पहुंच प्राप्त करें।"

#. A label displayed next to a companion contract.
msgctxt "companion"
msgid "Companion"
msgstr "साथी"

#. Windows Connect page status when the connection is down and the kill switch is deliberately blocking this computer's traffic.
msgctxt "conn_blocked_kill_switch"
msgid "Blocked — kill switch on"
msgstr "अवरुद्ध — किल स्विच चालू"

#. Settings: switch that connects automatically when the app starts.
msgctxt "conn_connect_on_launch"
msgid "Connect automatically when the app starts"
msgstr "ऐप शुरू होने पर स्वचालित रूप से कनेक्ट करें"

#. Settings: explanation under the connect-on-launch switch.
msgctxt "conn_connect_on_launch_note"
msgid "Off by default. When on, URnetwork connects to your selected provider as soon as you open the app. This changes the next launch - it does not connect now."
msgstr "डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से बंद। चालू होने पर, ऐप खोलते ही URnetwork आपके चुने हुए प्रदाता से कनेक्ट हो जाता है। यह अगली बार खोलने पर लागू होता है - अभी कनेक्ट नहीं करता।"

#. Windows and Linux connection status (Connect page headline, status strip and tray tooltip) when a working connection dropped and the app is reconnecting on its own.
msgctxt "conn_degraded"
msgid "Connection degraded — reconnecting"
msgstr "कनेक्शन कमज़ोर — फिर से कनेक्ट हो रहा है"

#. Windows Connect page status while the tunnel is being stopped but its routes are still installed.
msgctxt "conn_disconnecting"
msgid "Disconnecting — your traffic is still going through the tunnel"
msgstr "डिस्कनेक्ट हो रहा है — आपका ट्रैफ़िक अभी भी टनल से जा रहा है"

#. Connect screen status when the connect attempt failed: no provider could be reached (the sdk's CONNECT_FAILED). The connection keeps trying, and the app offers Retry.
msgctxt "conn_failed"
msgid "Couldn't connect"
msgstr "कनेक्ट नहीं हो सका"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line when connecting failed.
msgctxt "conn_failed_detail"
msgid "No providers could be reached. Retry rebuilds the connection from scratch."
msgstr "किसी भी प्रदाता तक नहीं पहुँचा जा सका। दोबारा कोशिश करने पर कनेक्शन शुरू से फिर बनता है।"

#. Windows Connect page: sentence appended to the line above when the service will stop a tunnel that carries nothing. Linux Connect page: shown on its own on the notice line under the connect controls while no other notice is there.
msgctxt "conn_failsafe_armed"
msgid "If nothing gets through shortly, URnetwork will turn the tunnel off automatically so you keep your internet."
msgstr "अगर जल्द ही कुछ नहीं पहुँचता, तो URnetwork टनल को अपने आप बंद कर देगा ताकि आपका इंटरनेट चलता रहे।"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page line after the service stopped a tunnel that carried nothing, while the kill switch keeps this computer blocked.
msgctxt "conn_failsafe_blocked"
msgid "The tunnel could not carry traffic, so URnetwork shut it down. The kill switch is on, so nothing leaves this machine until you connect again or turn the kill switch off — nothing is leaking."
msgstr "टनल ट्रैफ़िक नहीं ले जा पा रहा था, इसलिए URnetwork ने उसे बंद कर दिया। किल स्विच चालू है, इसलिए जब तक आप फिर से कनेक्ट नहीं करते या किल स्विच बंद नहीं करते, इस कंप्यूटर से कुछ भी बाहर नहीं जाता — कुछ भी लीक नहीं हो रहा।"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page line, and Windows tray notification, after the service stopped a tunnel that carried nothing, with the kill switch off. Keep the emphasis on NOT.
msgctxt "conn_failsafe_restored"
msgid "URnetwork disconnected you to keep you online: the tunnel was up but nothing was getting through. Your traffic is going out normally now and is NOT protected. Press Connect to try again."
msgstr "आपको ऑनलाइन रखने के लिए URnetwork ने आपको डिस्कनेक्ट कर दिया: टनल चालू था, लेकिन उससे कुछ भी नहीं गुज़र रहा था। आपका ट्रैफ़िक अब सामान्य रूप से बाहर जा रहा है और सुरक्षित नहीं है। फिर से कोशिश करने के लिए कनेक्ट दबाएँ।"

#. Connection status while the app has providers but none is proven to work yet (Linux and Windows Connect page headline, Windows tray tooltip).
msgctxt "conn_finding_providers"
msgid "Finding providers…"
msgstr "प्रदाता खोजे जा रहे हैं…"

#. Connect page and the out-of-balance or data-limit alert: warning that the internet traffic is not protected, shown when the tunnel is not capturing traffic.
msgctxt "conn_not_protected"
msgid "Your internet traffic is not protected."
msgstr "आपका इंटरनेट ट्रैफ़िक सुरक्षित नहीं है।"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line while the app's sign-in to the URnetwork platform keeps failing.
msgctxt "conn_reason_auth"
msgid "Signing in to the platform is failing…"
msgstr "प्लेटफ़ॉर्म में साइन इन विफल हो रहा है…"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line while the app cannot reach the URnetwork platform (the API servers).
msgctxt "conn_reason_platform"
msgid "Contacting the platform…"
msgstr "प्लेटफ़ॉर्म से संपर्क किया जा रहा है…"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line while the selected providers do not answer.
msgctxt "conn_reason_providers"
msgid "Providers not responding — retrying…"
msgstr "प्रदाता जवाब नहीं दे रहे — दोबारा कोशिश हो रही है…"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page reason line while the platform asks the app to slow down.
msgctxt "conn_reason_rate_limited"
msgid "Rate limited — waiting…"
msgstr "अनुरोध सीमा पूरी — प्रतीक्षा हो रही है…"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page line while connected but no provider carries traffic, with leak protection in force (on Linux, the kill switch's block floor).
msgctxt "conn_traffic_blocked"
msgid "No working provider right now — your traffic is blocked, not exposed. Disconnect to go back to your normal connection."
msgstr "अभी कोई काम करने वाला प्रदाता नहीं है — आपका ट्रैफ़िक अवरुद्ध है, उजागर नहीं। अपने सामान्य कनेक्शन पर लौटने के लिए डिस्कनेक्ट करें।"

#. Windows and Linux Connect page line while connected but no provider carries traffic, and leak protection (the Windows firewall policy, the Linux kill switch's block floor) is not in force.
msgctxt "conn_traffic_blocked_unprotected"
msgid "No working provider right now — traffic sent into the tunnel is going nowhere, and leak protection is off, so some traffic may bypass it. Disconnect to go back to your normal connection."
msgstr "अभी कोई काम करने वाला प्रदाता नहीं है — टनल में भेजा गया ट्रैफ़िक कहीं नहीं पहुँच रहा, और लीक सुरक्षा बंद है, इसलिए कुछ ट्रैफ़िक इसे बायपास कर सकता है। अपने सामान्य कनेक्शन पर लौटने के लिए डिस्कनेक्ट करें।"

#. Windows tray tooltip when the kill switch is deliberately blocking this computer's traffic.
msgctxt "conn_tray_blocked_kill_switch"
msgid "Blocked (kill switch on)"
msgstr "अवरुद्ध (किल स्विच चालू)"

#. Windows tray tooltip when leak protection blocks traffic while no tunnel is up.
msgctxt "conn_tray_blocked_no_tunnel"
msgid "Blocked — leak protection is still in force with no tunnel up"
msgstr "अवरुद्ध — कोई टनल चालू न होने पर भी लीक सुरक्षा लागू है"

#. Windows tray tooltip while the tunnel is being stopped but its routes are still installed.
msgctxt "conn_tray_disconnecting"
msgid "Disconnecting — traffic is still going through the tunnel"
msgstr "डिस्कनेक्ट हो रहा है — ट्रैफ़िक अभी भी टनल से जा रहा है"

#. Windows tray notification after the service stopped a tunnel that carried nothing, while the kill switch keeps this computer blocked. "This menu" is the tray icon's menu.
msgctxt "conn_tray_failsafe_blocked"
msgid "The tunnel could not carry traffic, so URnetwork shut it down. The kill switch is on, so this machine stays blocked and nothing is leaking. Reconnect, or turn off the kill switch from this menu."
msgstr "टनल ट्रैफ़िक नहीं ले जा पा रहा था, इसलिए URnetwork ने उसे बंद कर दिया। किल स्विच चालू है, इसलिए यह कंप्यूटर अवरुद्ध रहता है और कुछ भी लीक नहीं हो रहा। फिर से कनेक्ट करें, या इस मेनू से किल स्विच बंद करें।"

#. Windows tray tooltip after the service stopped a tunnel that carried nothing.
msgctxt "conn_tray_failsafe_stopped"
msgid "Disconnected (the tunnel failed)"
msgstr "डिस्कनेक्ट (टनल विफल रहा)"

#. Windows tray menu item that stops the tunnel directly when the normal Disconnect is stuck. Linux tray menu item that stops the service's tunnel while the app holds no session of its own.
msgctxt "conn_tray_force_tunnel_off"
msgid "Force the tunnel off (recovery)"
msgstr "टनल को ज़बरदस्ती बंद करें (रिकवरी)"

#. Windows and Linux tray menu item that lifts the kill switch's block on this computer.
msgctxt "conn_tray_lift_kill_switch"
msgid "Turn off the kill switch (unblock this machine)"
msgstr "किल स्विच बंद करें (इस कंप्यूटर को अनब्लॉक करें)"

#. Button text to connect to URnetwork VPN
msgctxt "connect"
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "कनेक्ट करें"

#. A description of how to connect a Solana wallet to add it as a sign-in method.
msgctxt "connect_a_solana_wallet_phantom_or_solflare"
msgid "Connect a Solana wallet (Phantom or Solflare) to add it as a sign-in method."
msgstr "Solana वॉलेट (Phantom या Solflare) कनेक्ट करें और उसे साइन-इन विधि के रूप में जोड़ें।"

#. Used in Main/Account/Settings/SettingsForm-iOS.swift.
msgctxt "connect_a_wallet"
msgid "Connect a wallet"
msgstr "एक वॉलेट कनेक्ट करें"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "connect_and_open"
msgid "Connect and open link"
msgstr "कनेक्ट करें और लिंक खोलें"

#. Button to connect a Bittensor coldkey.
msgctxt "connect_bittensor_wallet"
msgid "Connect Bittensor wallet"
msgstr "Bittensor वॉलेट कनेक्ट करें"

#. Add sign-in method sheet: the Bittensor wallet option's explanation (Talisman, WalletConnect, or a pasted signature).
