#. Login verify
msgctxt "login_verify_details"
msgid "Tell us who you really are. Enter the code we\nsent you to verify your identity."
msgstr "हमें बताएं कि आप वास्तव में कौन हैं। अपनी पहचान सत्यापित करने के लिए हमने आपको जो कोड भेजा है उसे दर्ज करें।"

#. Header for verify screen
msgctxt "login_verify_header"
msgid "You've got mail"
msgstr "आपके पास एक ईमेल है"

#. Points leaderboard: secondary stat, the best run of consecutive blocks with points.
msgctxt "longest_streak"
msgid "Longest streak"
msgstr "सबसे लंबी स्ट्रीक"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "low_user_ip_ratio"
msgid "Lowest user/IP ratio to access content"
msgstr "कंटेंट एक्सेस के लिए सबसे कम यूज़र/IP अनुपात"

#. Wallet Screen
msgctxt "make_default"
msgid "Make default"
msgstr "डिफ़ॉल्ट बनाएं"

#. Split tunnel settings: button opening the app split rules sheet.
msgctxt "manage_apps"
msgid "Manage apps"
msgstr "ऐप्लिकेशन प्रबंधित करें"

#. The device list (the network's devices and hosted proxies, each removable): the button in the client limit notice beside Get Pro, the row in Settings, and the screen's title. The user removes a device to free a slot so this device can connect.
msgctxt "manage_devices"
msgid "Manage devices"
msgstr "डिवाइस प्रबंधित करें"

#. Device list: shown after a removal freed a slot, while this device connects (or its sign-in runs again).
msgctxt "manage_devices_connecting"
msgid "Connecting this device…"
msgstr "यह डिवाइस कनेक्ट हो रहा है…"

#. Device list: the line above the list. A slot is one of the plan's concurrent connections (2 on the free plan); a connected device or hosted proxy takes one.
msgctxt "manage_devices_help"
msgid "Each connected device or proxy uses a slot of your plan. Remove one you no longer use to free its slot."
msgstr "हर कनेक्ट डिवाइस या प्रॉक्सी आपके प्लान की एक जगह लेता है। जिसका अब इस्तेमाल नहीं करते, उसे हटाकर उसकी जगह खाली करें।"

#. Device list, a row's second line for a device that is not connected now: when it last signed in. {time} is a relative time up to 7 days (such as "5m ago" or "now"), then a date ("Oct 3"), so the wording must read with either.
msgctxt "manage_devices_last_seen"
msgid "Last seen {}"
msgstr "आख़िरी बार देखा गया: {}"

#. Device list: the list could not be loaded. Retry is the button beside it.
msgctxt "manage_devices_load_failed"
msgid "Couldn't load your devices."
msgstr "आपके डिवाइस लोड नहीं हो सके।"

#. Device list: the label of a hosted proxy, a proxy the account runs from ur.io, the browser extension or the API. It takes a slot of the plan while connected, so the user can remove it too.
msgctxt "manage_devices_proxy"
msgid "Hosted proxy"
msgstr "होस्ट की गई प्रॉक्सी"

#. Device list: a removal failed and the device is still listed.
msgctxt "manage_devices_remove_failed"
msgid "Couldn't remove the device. Try again."
msgstr "डिवाइस नहीं हटाया जा सका। फिर से कोशिश करें।"

#. Device list: the title of the confirmation before a device or hosted proxy is removed. The body says it will be signed out (sessions_confirm_body_no_place); the buttons are Remove and Cancel.
msgctxt "manage_devices_remove_title"
msgid "Remove this device?"
msgstr "यह डिवाइस हटाएं?"

#. Device list: this app holds no sign-in token that can remove other devices, or the server refused it. Signing in again gives it one.
msgctxt "manage_devices_sign_in_required"
msgid "Sign in again to manage devices."
msgstr "डिवाइस प्रबंधित करने के लिए फिर से साइन इन करें।"

#. Device list: the label of the row for the device the app runs on. It cannot be removed here (the user signs out instead). On apple the same source text resolves to top200_sign_this_device, so the translations must stay the same as that key's.
msgctxt "manage_devices_this_device"
msgid "This device"
msgstr "यह डिवाइस"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "manage_subscription"
msgid "Manage subscription"
msgstr "सदस्यता प्रबंधित करें"

#. A label at the bottom of the contract stack
msgctxt "max_n"
msgid "max {}"
msgstr "अधिकतम {}"

#. Display name for the paid plan. The WIRE value stays "supporter" (subscription_type / current_subscription.plan) because already-shipped app versions parse that string; only what the user reads changes.
msgctxt "member"
msgid "Member"
msgstr "सदस्य"

#. A label for the picker that lets the user select the sign-in method.
msgctxt "method"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "विधि"

#. Compact relative-time label with an abbreviated minutes unit ("7m ago"), shown by the windows and linux stats formatters for events 1-59 minutes old. The argument is the elapsed minutes. Not a plural: the abbreviated unit does not inflect, but the word order and the unit abbreviation localize.
msgctxt "minutes_ago_abbrev"
msgid "{}m ago"
msgstr "{} मि. पहले"

#. Status shown while the device location is being synced with a provider. The argument is the provider's city or country.
msgctxt "mock_location_active"
msgid "Syncing with {}"
msgstr "{} के साथ सिंक हो रहा है"

#. Disclosure shown with the browser geolocation override toggle: the simulated location is reported only to pages in this browser, not to the device.
msgctxt "mock_location_disclosure_browser_only"
msgid "Only pages in this browser see the changed location. Your device's location is unchanged."
msgstr "बदला हुआ स्थान सिर्फ़ इस ब्राउज़र के पेज देखते हैं। आपके डिवाइस का स्थान नहीं बदलता।"

#. Disclosure shown with the mock location toggle: apps can detect a simulated location and may refuse to work.
msgctxt "mock_location_disclosure_detectable"
msgid "Apps can tell the location is simulated. Banking, ride-hailing, delivery and some game apps may refuse to work while this is on."
msgstr "ऐप्लिकेशन पहचान सकते हैं कि स्थान नकली है। बैंकिंग, राइड-हेलिंग, डिलीवरी और कुछ गेम ऐप्लिकेशन इसके चालू रहने पर काम करने से मना कर सकते हैं।"

#. Disclosure shown with the mock location toggle: the simulated location is reported to every app on the device, not only URnetwork.
msgctxt "mock_location_disclosure_device_wide"
msgid "This changes the location reported to every app on your device, not just URnetwork."
msgstr "इससे आपके डिवाइस के हर ऐप्लिकेशन को दिखने वाला स्थान बदल जाता है, सिर्फ़ URnetwork को नहीं।"

#. Disclosure shown with the browser geolocation override toggle: sites can detect a simulated location and may refuse to work.
msgctxt "mock_location_disclosure_sites_can_detect"
msgid "Sites can tell the location is simulated and may refuse to work."
msgstr "साइटें पहचान सकती हैं कि स्थान नकली है और काम करने से मना कर सकती हैं।"

#. Disclosure shown with the mock location toggle: turn the feature off in URnetwork before removing it as the mock location app, or the device location can stay frozen.
msgctxt "mock_location_disclosure_turn_off_first"
msgid "Turn this off in URnetwork before you turn off developer options, deselect URnetwork, or uninstall the app — otherwise your device location can stay frozen until you restart."
msgstr "डेवलपर विकल्प बंद करने, URnetwork का चयन हटाने या ऐप्लिकेशन अनइंस्टॉल करने से पहले इसे URnetwork में बंद करें — वरना आपके डिवाइस का स्थान रीस्टार्ट करने तक अटका रह सकता है।"

#. Recovery instructions in that card, and the only in-app guidance for restoring the device's real GPS.
msgctxt "mock_location_error_stuck_detail"
msgid "URnetwork was deselected while active, so Android locked the simulated GPS. Re-select URnetwork in Developer options to restore your real GPS, or restart your phone."
msgstr "URnetwork चालू रहते हुए उसका चयन हटा दिया गया, इसलिए Android ने नकली GPS को लॉक कर दिया। अपना असली GPS वापस पाने के लिए डेवलपर विकल्प में URnetwork को फिर से चुनें, या अपना फ़ोन रीस्टार्ट करें।"

#. Title of the recovery card shown at the top of the mock location guide when the simulated location is stuck.
msgctxt "mock_location_error_stuck_title"
msgid "Simulated location is stuck"
msgstr "नकली स्थान अटका हुआ है"

#. Button on the optional location permission step.
msgctxt "mock_location_grant_permission"
msgid "Grant permission"
msgstr "अनुमति दें"

#. Intro of the mock location guide explaining that apps see the longest-connected provider's location instead of the real one.
msgctxt "mock_location_guide_intro"
msgid "When enabled, apps on this device see the location of the provider you have been connected to the longest, instead of your real location."
msgstr "चालू होने पर, इस डिवाइस के ऐप्लिकेशन आपके असली स्थान के बजाय उस प्रदाता का स्थान देखते हैं जिससे आप सबसे लंबे समय से कनेक्ट हैं।"

#. Title of the mock location setup guide.
msgctxt "mock_location_guide_title"
msgid "Sync device location"
msgstr "डिवाइस का स्थान सिंक करें"

#. Short status shown when the mock location feature still needs Android setup steps.
msgctxt "mock_location_needs_setup"
msgid "Setup required"
msgstr "सेटअप ज़रूरी है"

#. Button that opens the Android About phone settings screen.
msgctxt "mock_location_open_about_phone"
msgid "Open About phone"
msgstr "“फ़ोन के बारे में जानकारी” खोलें"

#. Button that replaces Grant permission once Android will no longer show the permission dialog, opening the app's settings page instead.
msgctxt "mock_location_open_app_settings"
msgid "Open app settings"
msgstr "ऐप्लिकेशन की सेटिंग खोलें"

#. Button that opens the Android developer options settings screen.
msgctxt "mock_location_open_developer_options"
msgid "Open developer options"
msgstr "डेवलपर विकल्प खोलें"

#. Button that opens the Android system location settings screen.
msgctxt "mock_location_open_location_settings"
msgid "Open location settings"
msgstr "जगह की जानकारी की सेटिंग खोलें"

#. Mock location guide status when setup is complete and the toggle can be turned on.
msgctxt "mock_location_ready"
msgid "Ready. Turn on the toggle to sync your device location with the oldest provider."
msgstr "तैयार है। अपने डिवाइस का स्थान सबसे लंबे समय से कनेक्ट प्रदाता के साथ सिंक करने के लिए टॉगल चालू करें।"

#. Settings row label for the device location sync (mock location) feature.
msgctxt "mock_location_settings_row"
msgid "Device location sync"
msgstr "डिवाइस स्थान सिंक"

#. Settings row status while the mock location engine retries after a transient failure.
msgctxt "mock_location_status_retrying"
msgid "Retrying — simulated location paused"
msgstr "फिर से कोशिश हो रही है — नकली स्थान रोका गया"

#. Settings row status: the simulated location is stuck on because the app was removed from Android's mock-location picker while active.
msgctxt "mock_location_status_stuck"
msgid "GPS frozen — action needed"
msgstr "GPS अटका है — कार्रवाई ज़रूरी है"

#. Mock location setup step: enable Android developer options by tapping the build number in About phone.
msgctxt "mock_location_step_developer_options"
msgid "Turn on developer options: open About phone and tap Build number seven times."
msgstr "डेवलपर विकल्प चालू करें: “फ़ोन के बारे में जानकारी” खोलें और “बिल्ड नंबर” पर सात बार टैप करें।"

#. Optional setup step: the approximate location grant that Google Play services needs to mirror the simulated location to its own location provider. The feature works without it.
msgctxt "mock_location_step_location_permission"
msgid "Optional: allow approximate location so Chrome and other Google Play apps follow the simulated location too. Everything else works without it."
msgstr "वैकल्पिक: “अनुमानित जगह की जानकारी” की अनुमति दें ताकि Chrome और Google Play के दूसरे ऐप्लिकेशन को भी नकली स्थान मिले। बाकी सब कुछ इसके बिना भी काम करता है।"

#. Mock location setup step: turn on the system Location setting so apps receive the simulated location.
msgctxt "mock_location_step_location_services"
msgid "Turn on Location in system settings so apps can receive the location."
msgstr "सिस्टम सेटिंग में “जगह की जानकारी” चालू करें ताकि ऐप्लिकेशन को स्थान मिल सके।"

#. Mock location setup step: choose URnetwork as the mock location app in Android developer options.
msgctxt "mock_location_step_select_app"
msgid "In developer options, tap Select mock location app and choose URnetwork."
msgstr "डेवलपर विकल्प में, “मॉक लोकेशन ऐप चुनें” पर टैप करें और URnetwork चुनें।"

#. Status shown while the mock location feature waits for a connected provider's location to become known.
msgctxt "mock_location_waiting_for_provider"
msgid "Waiting for a provider location"
msgstr "प्रदाता के स्थान की प्रतीक्षा हो रही है"

